  "description": "The story follows a fire-breathing, human-hating dragon raised by a mother cat in a forest. The dragon, known affectionately as \"Uncle Wing,\" watches over the many curious cats — such as one that goes on an adventure with a human prince, and another that lives in the city and people-watches as a hobby — and gradually warms up to humans along the way.<br><br>\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)<br><br>\n<i>Note: Each episode streamed 1 week early on ABEMA and dAnimeStore. The original TV broadcast started on July 4, 2026.</i>",
